--
-- Grouped one entry per LOCATION rather than per recipe: the same vendor
-- backs up to a hundred recipes, so this stays diffable by place and holds
-- one table per location instead of one per recipe.
--
-- Map IDs are raw uiMapIDs, not MC.MAP constants: many of these zones have
-- no constant, and a generated file gains nothing from the symbol.
